                "description": "The Brisbane 8 Inch Pull is rectangular in shape, granting it a modern feel that makes it a great choice for contemporary home remodels. This Modern 8 Inch Brisbane Door Handle comes with everything you'll need to thru-bolt it on a door up to 1-3/4 inches thick. It is available in a wide array of beautiful finishes.",
